  "description": {
    "raw": "You hurl a tiny ball of negative energy, destroying plant life either in a line 60 feet long or a 10-foot-radius spread. This effect removes the cover and concealment provided by trees and undergrowth, eliminates the movement penalties associated with undergrowth, and so forth.\n\nYou may also target a single plant creature with this spell. You must succeed on a ranged touch attack to hit your target. An affected plant creature takes 2d8 points of damage.",
    "search_text": "\"you hurl a tiny ball of negative energy, destroying plant life either in a line 60 feet long or a 10-foot-radius spread. this effect removes the cover and concealment provided by trees and undergrowth, eliminates the movement penalties associated with undergrowth, and so forth.\\n\\nyou may also target a single plant creature with this spell. you must succeed on a ranged touch attack to hit your target. an affected plant creature takes 2d8 points of damage.\"",
